# Training and evaluation data
# Legal source documents are often confidential or contain personal data,
# so data files stay out of version control by default. Directory patterns
# are anchored to the repository root: an unanchored `data/` once excluded
# the legalkit/data/ package itself.
/data/
/datasets/
*.jsonl
*.json
# Small synthetic fixtures that ship with the project are allowed.
!/examples/**/*.jsonl
!/examples/**/*.json
!/tests/**/*.jsonl
!/tests/**/*.json
!/legalkit/**/*.jsonl
!/legalkit/**/*.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log
logs/
